## Summary: The Decision Tree

```
User Request
    │
    ▼
Classify: FastTrack or Full Pipeline?
    │
    ├── FastTrack → Direct implementation → Verify → Commit
    │
    └── Full Pipeline →
        │
        ▼
        Deep Reasoning (300+ words)
        │
        ├── TDD Cycle (for code tasks)
        │
        ├── Implementation
        │
        ├── Two-Stage Review
        │   ├── Spec Compliance Review
        │   └── Code Quality Review
        │
        └── Commit
```

